  10:./Application/BSPSys/BSPDevice/KA84917/BSPKA84917_async.c **** ** @Function     : KA84917驱动模块 — 异步SPI版本
  11:./Application/BSPSys/BSPDevice/KA84917/BSPKA84917_async.c **** ** @Instructions : 基于spi_async.h定时器中断+DMA状态机, 非阻塞通信
  12:./Application/BSPSys/BSPDevice/KA84917/BSPKA84917_async.c **** **                 与原BSPKA84917.c的区别:
  13:./Application/BSPSys/BSPDevice/KA84917/BSPKA84917_async.c **** **                 - vSPI_2byte_read/write/Continue_Read/FifoContRead 改为入队+等待
  14:./Application/BSPSys/BSPDevice/KA84917/BSPKA84917_async.c **** **                 - KA84917_maintask() 不再阻塞等待SPI完成
  15:./Application/BSPSys/BSPDevice/KA84917/BSPKA84917_async.c **** **                 - 采样周期: 主循环10ms, 分片轮转(4片×2周期=80ms完整一轮)
  16:./Application/BSPSys/BSPDevice/KA84917/BSPKA84917_async.c **** **===========================================================================================*/
  17:./Application/BSPSys/BSPDevice/KA84917/BSPKA84917_async.c **** #if 1
